#ntdiff PRIVATE/NTOS/VIDEO/JAZZG364/JAZZG364.C PRIVATE/NTOS/VIDEO/JAZZG300/JAZZG300.C PRIVATE/NTOS/VIDEO/JZVXL484/JZVXL484.C
=1 1 6
+    bcmvideo.c
=1 8 3
+    This module contains the code that implements the video miniport driver
+    of the VideoCore of the BCM2835 in the Raspberry Pi 2.
+
+    The firmware has the VideoCore allocate a frame buffer through the mailbox
+    property channel and describes it as the display controller of the
+    system: its identifier and configuration data (bcmvdeo.h) give the frame
+    buffer and its pixel format, the monitor peripheral below it the screen.
+    The driver offers that one mode, a direct color frame buffer; there is
+    no palette and no hardware pointer.
=1 13 5
=1 20 8
+#include "bcmvdeo.h"
+
